  "body": "This specifies the layout model of buttons (the button element,\nthe input element in the Button, Reset, Submit states, and the\nbutton part of input in the File Upload state).\n\nFixes #1024. Fixes #2948. Fixes #4081. Part of #4082.\n\nTests: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/14824\n\nBugs:\nhttps://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=962936\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=197879\nhttps://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1539469\n\n---\n\ncc @MatsPalmgren @tkent-google @whsieh @bzbarsky\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4143/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on May 14, 2019, 1:50 PM UTC (2c45e0d)\">/index.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4143/c501dd8...2c45e0d/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on May 14, 2019, 1:50 PM UTC (2c45e0d)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4143/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on May 14, 2019, 1:50 PM UTC (2c45e0d)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4143/c501dd8...2c45e0d/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on May 14, 2019, 1:50 PM UTC (2c45e0d)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4143/references.html\" title=\"Last updated on May 14, 2019, 1:50 PM UTC (2c45e0d)\">/references.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4143/c501dd8...2c45e0d/references.html\" title=\"Last updated on May 14, 2019, 1:50 PM UTC (2c45e0d)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4143/rendering.html\" title=\"Last updated on May 14, 2019, 1:50 PM UTC (2c45e0d)\">/rendering.